{"t":"MTB","made":"2026-11-19 01:25","name":"M&T Bank Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","employees":21562,"hq":"Buffalo, NY, United States","website":"https://www.mtb.com","summary_en":"M&T Bank Corporation operates as a bank holding company for Manufacturers and Traders Trust Company and Wilmington Trust, National Association that provides retail and commercial banking products and services in the United States. The company operates through three segments: Commercial Bank, Retail Bank, and Institutional Services and Wealth Management. It offers a range of credit products and banking services, such as commercial lending and leasing, letters of credits, deposit products, cash management services, commercial real estate loans, and credit facilities secured by various commercial real estate properties to middle-market and large commercial customers. The company also provides customers deposit products, including demand, savings and time accounts, and other services; automobile and recreational finance loans, home equity loans and lines of credit, credit cards, and other loan products, as well as residential mortgage and real estate loans; business loans, cash management, payroll, direct deposit, and merchant credit card services to consumers and small businesses through branch network, telephone banking, internet banking, and automated teller machines. In addition, it offers trustee, agency, investment management, and administrative services; personal trust, planning and advisory, fiduciary, asset management, family office, and other services; and investment products, including mutual funds and annuities, and other services for corporations and institutions, investment bankers, corporate tax, finance and legal executives, and other institutional clients. M&T Bank Corporation was founded in 1856 and is headquartered in Buffalo, New York.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"M&T Bank Corporation은 미국에서 소매 및 상업 은행 상품과 서비스를 제공하는 Manufacturer and Traders Trust Company 및 Wilmington Trust, National Association의 은행 지주 회사로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 상업 은행, 소매 은행, 기관 서비스 및 자산 관리의 세 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 상업용 대출 및 리스, 신용장, 예금 상품, 현금 관리 서비스, 상업용 부동산 대출, 다양한 상업용 부동산을 담보로 하는 신용 ​​시설 등 다양한 신용 상품 및 은행 서비스를 중견 시장 및 대규모 상업 고객에게 제공합니다. 회사는 또한 수요, 저축, 시간 계좌 및 기타 서비스를 포함한 예금 상품을 고객에게 제공합니다. 자동차 및 레크리에이션 금융 대출, 주택 담보 대출 및 신용 한도, 신용 카드 및 기타 대출 상품, 주택 담보 대출 및 부동산 대출; 지점 네트워크, 텔레뱅킹, 인터넷 뱅킹, 현금자동입출금기를 통해 소비자와 중소기업을 대상으로 기업 대출, 현금 관리, 급여, 계좌 입금, 가맹점 신용 카드 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 수탁자, 대행사, 투자 관리 및 행정 서비스도 제공합니다. 개인 신탁, 계획 및 자문, 신탁, 자산 관리, 패밀리 오피스 및 기타 서비스; 기업 및 기관, 투자 은행가, 법인세, 재무 및 법률 임원, 기타 기관 고객을 위한 뮤추얼 펀드 및 연금, 기타 서비스를 포함한 투자 상품. M&T Bank Corporation은 1856년에 설립되었으며 뉴욕주 버팔로에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":215.1,"mcap":30852747264.0,"pe":11.238245,"fpe":10.184761,"peg":1.2781,"ps":3.2600112,"pb":1.229459,"ev_ebitda":null,"div":3.34,"beta":0.642,"hi52":255.95,"lo52":180.49},"fin":{"rev":9464000512.0,"rev_g":0.005,"eps_g":0.046,"gross":0.0,"op":0.42159998,"net":0.31868,"roe":0.106029995,"fcf":null,"cash":16586000384.0,"debt":20960000000.0,"de":null,"eps":19.14,"feps":21.11979},"own":{"short":0.0399,"inst":0.87921995,"insider":0.00324},"analyst":{"n":21,"mean":245.92857,"median":245.0,"high":294.0,"low":198.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.77273,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":3,"hold":14,"sell":2,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":3,"hold":14,"sell":2,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":2,"buy":3,"hold":14,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":1,"buy":3,"hold":15,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-27","Firm":"Wolfe Research","ToGrade":"Underperform","FromGrade":"Peer Perform","Action":"down","priceTargetAction":"","currentPriceTarget":0.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":230.0,"priorPriceTa